<title>SINGAPORE: Lum Chang in venture to buy London hotel.</title>
<headline>Lum Chang in venture to buy London hotel.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lum Chang Holdings Ltd said on Thursday its unit L.C. Hotels Pte Ltd had entered a 50-50 joint venture with SC Global (London) Pte Ltd to buy the Green Park Hotel in London, England for 30 million pounds.  </p>
<p>Lum Chang said in a statement the venture partners had paid a 10 percent deposit for the hotel. The purchase would be completed by June 19. It gave no other financial details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
